<title>FRANCE: Algeria tenders for 150,000 tonnes wheat -traders.</title>
<headline>Algeria tenders for 150,000 tonnes wheat -traders.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Algeria has launched a tender to import 150,000 tonnes of French or U.S. or Argentine milling wheat, or any combination of the three, for shipment in January and February, European grain traders said on Monday.  </p>
<p>Exporters have until 1500 GMT on Monday to submit offers.</p>
<p>The tender runs until Thursday, traders said.</p>
<p>Tonnages and shipment details provided by traders are as follows-</p>
<p>    Tonnage			   Shipment date</p>
<p>    25,000 tonnes		   January 1-15</p>
<p>    25,000 tonnes		   January 5-20</p>
<p>    50,000 tonnes		   February 1-15</p>
<p>    50,000 tonnes		   February 10-25</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5146</p>
</text>
